card.statement:
There exist $x\in\stab_{\W}(\th)$ and $y\in\stab_{\W}(\ph)$ of order two such that

[label={\roman*)}]

- $\Phi^{-1}\Theta=T_yT_x^{-1}$ and $\Phi\Theta^{-1}=T_y^{-1}T_x$;

- $\Psi=T_x^{-1}T_y^{-1}$ and $\isP=T_y^{-1}T_x^{-1}$;

- $\Theta=T_y \Thetap T_y$ and $\Phi=T_x \Phip T_x$.

Furthermore,

[resume, label={\roman*)}]

- If $\Rring$ is doubly-laced then $T_x=\Thetap$ and $T_y=\Phip$;

- If $\Rring$ is doubly-laced and $(\th, \a_{i_\th}^\vee)(\th^\vee,\a_{i_\th})=2$ then $T_y=T_{i_\th}$;

- If $\Rring$ is doubly-laced and $(\ph, \a_{i_\ph}^\vee)(\ph^\vee,\a_{i_\ph})=2$ then $T_x=T_{i_\ph}$;

- If $\Rring$ is triply-laced then $T_x=T_{i_\ph}$ and $T_y=T_{i_\th}$.
